<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verification Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f9faf6;
            color: #191c1b;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            border: 1px solid #edeeeb;
        }
        .otp-box {
            background-color: #f3f4f1;
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 24px 0;
            border: 1px dashed #1a4d3c;
        }
        .otp-code {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1a4d3c;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Hello <%= name %>,</h2>
        <p>Your verification code for FIFTH SENSE PERFUMES is provided below. For your security, this code will expire in 5 minutes.</p>
        <div class="otp-box">
            <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #707974;">If you did not request this code, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

